# Care Reality Model Before Language

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-care-reality-situation-model.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-care-reality-situation-model.md)

## Critical

Not a keyword system. Infer change from messy context: *what appears different from this person's normal state?*

## Always ask internally

What was normal before? · What appears different now? · What event may explain it? · What remains uncertain?

## Before any caregiver response

Build the Care Reality Model (person · baseline · changes · timeline · events · decisions · outcomes · unknowns · engine confidence).  
Then generate orientation — not advice or summary theater.

## Pipeline

Ingestion → Extraction → Prioritization → Situation modeling → Response generation → UI  

**Before changing UI:** inspect this pipeline. Do not patch examples. Fix reasoning architecture.

